All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on Keep a Changelog,
and this project adheres to Semantic Versioning.

## [3.0.0] 2026-08-06

### Added
 - generate:config tool (ex generate:init which now run all project setup)
 - autodetect the current project root
 - generate:init tool
 - register:project tool
 - setup tool

### Updated
 - phx-tools => phx-cli
 - dependencies
 - generate:config non-interactive mode
 - all tools interactive mode
 - complete rewrite
 - generate:iconset temp assets uniqid filename

### Removed
 - example assets

